net-operator-sdk/issues/1044)) ([6778754](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/6778754882d3d00a501e8351cabf4a09379ec393))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1041](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1041)) ([b2e98a0](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/b2e98a04e723e0707f7e51cdc6cd838c8b7dec15))\n* **tools:** update dependency nuget-license to v4.0.7 ([#1043](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1043)) ([9c20c70](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/9c20c7001eaf266f2ab992dc7fe21e02944e7089))\n'",
